  "name": "linkedin post planner with ai drafts and approval",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4454a8d5-b980-4ee7-b250-7798966e5fb8",
      "name": "Overview Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -560,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 800,
        "content": "## 09-05-11 linkedin post planner with ai drafts and approval\n\n### How it works\n- A daily schedule reads the post calendar sheet and gates rows to Approved, dated today, and not yet Published, so re-runs never double post.\n- The approval side lane sends rows marked pending_review to a manager on Telegram for a quick approve or reject edit in the sheet.\n- Each approved row runs through the loop: load the brand guide, draft the post with a primary OpenRouter model plus a structured fallback, parse the output, generate an image, host it, and publish to LinkedIn.\n- If publishing fails, the row is flagged as Error in the sheet and the admin is alerted on Telegram. Hard workflow errors are emailed to the alert inbox.\n- After the loop, a Telegram digest reports how many posts went out that day.\n\n### Setup\n- Point the calendar and brand guide nodes at your own Google Sheet with columns: id, Date Scheduled, Date Created, Topic, Content, Image, Status.\n- Set Status to Approved and Date Scheduled to dd/MM/yyyy on rows you want published today.\n- Connect credentials for Google Sheets, OpenRouter, OpenAI, imgbb, upload-post, Telegram, and SMTP email.\n- Set the environment variables ADMIN_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID and MANAGER_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID used by the alert nodes.\n\n### Customization\n- Adjust the cron expression to change the publish hour, or swap the fallback model inside the Draft Post Copy chain."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "56377254-9caf-4b2d-80be-a21dfa3a619d",
      "name": "Alerts Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        16,
        912
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 592,
        "height": 346,
        "content": "## Alerts\nPer-post publish failures alert on Telegram and mark the row Error. Workflow crashes email the alert inbox. A Telegram digest closes the run."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
